(text "64 contacts: 52 MCU signal pads + 2 core 5V feed + 2 core 3V3 reference + CTRL_READY + 7 GND." (at 20.32 116.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3ec8883e-f5aa-513d-8884-07fb9815e99d"))
(text "All MCU GPIOs are exposed by port name. PG10 stays NRST; PF0/PF1 share optional HSE; PB8 shares BOOT." (at 20.32 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "988a8f33-285d-57ba-829b-f0da69d282af"))
(text "PC7 is RUN_ARM when plugged into this power base. CTRL_READY = Schmitt-reset-ok AND PC7; default LOW." (at 20.32 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5bfea66b-9dec-5e4d-ae23-c023a7baabe2"))
(text "Standalone core: regulated 4.75-5.25V at J101 pins1/3 and GND. Do not parallel independent 5V sources." (at 20.32 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "796973db-09bf-5ce2-95fd-7a612c22952c"))
(text "3V3 reference is core -> base clamps / fault pull-up / SWD sense only. Never parallel base and core regulators." (at 20.32 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0dfba17a-4f22-5a44-bf4e-a19c56a993a3"))
(text "Application ABZ / SPI / UART / SWD / CAN / LEDs / ADC filters all reside on the power baseboard." (at 20.32 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eaaf0281-1a4d-57bf-879a-f1238c2b5a42"))
